; TinyDev.cd - catalog description of TinyDev (built-in language: english)
;
; Format of CatComp/FlexCat. amiga-devkit/tools/catcomp.py makes
; include/tinydev_strings.h and the catalogs from it; translations are
; catalogs/<language>.ct. Keep the format specifiers (%s, %lu, %ld) and
; their order in translations, and keep the '_' shortcuts unique within
; each window. Until the first release the strings may be reordered.
;
